 he Panhandle. Advance tickets run $10\, or $15 at the door\, and proceeds
  go toward the planned Gulf Coast Surfing Museum in Gulf Breeze. The afte
 rnoon also includes door prizes\, a 50/50 drawing\, and food and beverage
 s available for purchase. The screening runs from 1 to 5 PM on September 
 13.\nPrice: from $10\nArea: Pensacola\nTimes: Sunday 9/13 · 1:00 PM to 5
